{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the <i>Card Simulation: Chinese Restaurant</i> Demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world of culinary delight where simple, addictive drag-and-drop mechanics bring the kitchen to life. Combine a vast array of fresh ingredients to craft dozens of mouth-watering traditional Chinese delicacies, satisfying the unique cravings of every customer that walks through your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/04eb4803978d4d065951030cc095f6e5.avif?t=1768876472\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Culinary Mastery:</strong> From humble home-style dishes like <i>Green Pepper Scrambled Eggs</i> to the exquisite <i>Glutinous Rice Eight-Treasure Duck</i>\u2014and even the legendary <i>Manchu-Han Imperial Feast</i>\u2014there are dozens of ingredients and hundreds of recipes waiting for you to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/8c926394acaee7014422d9ff4aee3e81.avif?t=1768876472\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refine Your Craft:</strong> Upgrade your signature dishes to perfection and unlock powerful buffs to boost your efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/0a1636414cc0a2abad8fb2a40524d02d.avif?t=1768876472\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Empire:</strong> Purchase new equipment, expand your floor plan, and customize your restaurant's decor to maximize your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/26ac199c3e6fab54897a21f80d9bee82.avif?t=1768876472\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Menu Management:</strong> Choose your offerings wisely! A menu that is too large might just overwhelm your kitchen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/7150e8c0c4179e8ab68ec7de130d3b67.avif?t=1768876472\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the game now to discover even more exciting gameplay mechanics and hidden surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Please note: This is a Demo version. Some features are still under development, and you may encounter undiscovered bugs. If you run into any issues during your playthrough, please please reach out and let me know. Your feedback is incredibly appreciated!)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978850?t=1768876472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978850?t=1768876472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/3c1b89d22dfd08c0a720927835dbc4e42e5c3e49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768876472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/3c1b89d22dfd08c0a720927835dbc4e42e5c3e49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768876472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4034010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welco